  "body_html": "<h3>Early career optometrists are invited to a retina education event presented by members of the Queensland Eye Institute clinical faculty.</h3>\n<p><img alt=\"Optometry retina education event speakers\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-6217 size-full\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"444\" id=\"longdesc-return-6217\" longdesc=\"https://qei.org.au?longdesc=6217&amp;referrer=6209\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1362px) 100vw, 1362px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Optom-Event-Feb26-speakers.png\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Optom-Event-Feb26-speakers.png 1362w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Optom-Event-Feb26-speakers-300x98.png 300w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Optom-Event-Feb26-speakers-1024x334.png 1024w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Optom-Event-Feb26-speakers-768x250.png 768w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Optom-Event-Feb26-speakers-800x261.png 800w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Optom-Event-Feb26-speakers-400x130.png 400w\" tabindex=\"-1\" width=\"1362\"/></p>\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><img alt=\"Logo for Optometry Australia and CPD points awarded\" class=\"wp-image-6210 alignleft\" data-warning=\"Suspicious alt text\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"324\" id=\"longdesc-return-6016\" longdesc=\"https://qei.org.au?longdesc=6016&amp;referrer=5995\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/QA-logo-1.jpg\" tabindex=\"-1\" width=\"189\"/></div>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Tuesday, 3rd February 2026</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">6:00 pm – 9:00 pm</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\">Supernormal restaurant<br/>\n443 Queen St<br/>\nBrisbane</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/2c1A5B8XZCViwoNM7\">View map</a></p>\n<p>Numbers are strictly limited and registration is essential to secure your place.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"Sign saying 'sorry registration closed'\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-6221 size-medium\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"259\" id=\"longdesc-return-6221\" longdesc=\"https://qei.org.au?longdesc=6221&amp;referrer=6209\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" src=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed-300x259.png\" srcset=\"../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed-300x259.png 300w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed-348x300.png 348w, ../../wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Registration-closed.png 500w\" tabindex=\"-1\" width=\"300\"/></p>",
